<article class="env-lemma" id="07SY">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/07SY">Lemma <span data-tag="07SY">81.6.1</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X \to X'$ be a thickening of schemes over $S$ and let $X \to Y$ be an affine morphism of schemes over $S$. Let $Y' = Y \amalg _ X X'$ be the pushout in the category of schemes (see More on Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/07RT" data-tag="07RT">37.14.3</a>). Then $Y'$ is also a pushout in the category of algebraic spaces over $S$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is an immediate consequence of Lemma <a href="/tag/07SX" data-tag="07SX">81.3.1</a> and More on Morphisms, Lemmas <a href="/tag/07RT" data-tag="07RT">37.14.3</a>, <a href="/tag/07RV" data-tag="07RV">37.14.4</a>, and <a href="/tag/07RX" data-tag="07RX">37.14.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>